647
00:41:07.440 --> 00:41:09.280
Nine miles.

648
00:41:09.400 --> 00:41:11.840
Nine miles there. Nine miles back.

649
00:41:12.000 --> 00:41:15.280
So I think the question we need to
ask ourselves as a family

650
00:41:15.400 --> 00:41:18.920
